### geometry insight captured
- node group is 8×(4×4×4-1=63) cubes, 4×4×4 void = ghost cube slot
  void derivation: 2px gap (1+1 boundaries) + 1+1 missing corner subcubes = 4
  corrects earlier wrong 20×20×20 / 10×10×10 numbers
- void as 6+1 platform: large enough for 63-cube 90° rotation, 6 face
  directions each anchor adjacent space, void = omnidirectional sensing probe,
  each node group is center of its own space. geometric derivation of 6+1.
- zenki as satellites around a work/memory ring: ring buffers+translates
  between free-rotation zenki and cubic grid routes; data flows electrically
  along ring; routes stay static near ring while zenki orbit freely

