== key technical notes ==

- :template-name: prefix syntax now works in coding.intake.parse_command_string
  example: bin/coding-task ":bug-fix: investigate X"
- coding.show-buffer model_output — live inference view
- coding.reload source — hot-reload modules without model restart
- bin/coding-task -file task.md — dispatch from file
- read_file now line-based: offset=N means start at line N, length=N means N lines
- GPU at 98-100% = healthy; drop to 60-70% = context pressure building
- Firefox uses VRAM — close it before spawning coding zenka inference server
- coding.cfg.vram_safety_mb = 200 works when model barely fits (default 1024)
- kimi-task -next for fresh session, but parallel sessions burn tokens fast
  → -queue option planned but not yet implemented (poll session-info until idle)

